{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-fourier","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:categorical-fourier","kind":"definition","title":"Categorical Fourier transform","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-laplace","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-tannaka-krein-reconstruction","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-brings-smoothness"],"tags":["hopf-algebra","grouplike","monoidal-functor","fourier","peter-weyl","tannakian"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.CategoricalFourier","text":"categorical-fourier-transform.md","leanSource":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-fourier-transform.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:categorical-fourier\"></a><p>The <strong>categorical Fourier transform</strong> pairs against the unitary grouplike <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\exp_q(i\\xi\\cdot)</code>:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\mathcal{F}\\colon \\bigl(\\mathrm{End}_{\\mathbf{C}}(A), \\ast_q\\bigr) \\;\\longrightarrow\\; \\bigl(\\mathrm{End}_{\\mathbf{C}}(A), \\cdot\\bigr), \\qquad \\mathcal{F}[f](\\xi) \\;=\\; \\mathrm{tr}_M\\bigl(\\exp_q(i\\xi\\cdot) \\cdot f\\bigr),</code></pre>\n<p>where <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\xi</code> ranges over the categorical spectrum <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathbf{C}}(\\mathbf{1}, A^\\vee)</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-fourier-transform.md","leanStatus":"proved","heading":"Definition","number":"3.20.11"}
